<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#f7eee5"><meta name="description" content="A little world of memories, letters and birthday wishes, made just for Gunduuu."><title>Happy Birthday Gunduuu 💗😚</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css"></head><body class="locked">
<section id="entrance" class="entrance" aria-labelledby="entrance-title"><div class="entrance-top"><span>FOR YOU, WITH LOVE</span><span>23 / 10 / 2026</span></div><div class="entrance-layout"><div class="entrance-art"><svg class="bow-art" viewBox="0 0 200 130" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M94 53C64 10 9 5 18 41c5 23 42 28 76 20M106 53c30-43 85-48 76-12-5 23-42 28-76 20"/><path d="M88 57C53 34 34 28 24 35m88 22c35-23 54-29 64-22"/><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M91 61c-3 25-21 42-44 47l13-20-22-4c25 1 40-10 53-23m18 0c3 25 21 42 44 47l-13-20 22-4c-25 1-40-10-53-23"/><path fill="#D46C8C" d="M90 48q10-5 20 0v18q-10 5-20 0z"/></g></svg><div class="cutout-backdrop"></div><img class="couple-cutout" src="assets/entrance-couple.webp" alt="The two of us, arm in arm" fetchpriority="high"><span class="art-note">a little world,<br>just for us.</span><svg class="flower-art" viewBox="0 0 140 210" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M68 202c8-53 15-100 3-143M73 153c-33 1-49-17-48-36 28-2 43 15 48 36m4-26c35-2 46-26 41-42-24 3-37 19-41 42" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><g class="flower-head" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="#FBB3BB"><path d="M70 45C39-8 9 22 43 53 0 69 29 107 58 76c1 46 46 44 34 3 39 19 57-23 18-32 21-38-18-53-40-2Z"/><circle cx="73" cy="60" r="14" fill="#D46C8C"/></g></svg></div><div class="entrance-note"><span class="tiny-label">YOU + ME + A LITTLE SECRET</span><h1 id="entrance-title">Hi, Gunduuu.<br><em>You’re the key.</em></h1><p>Oru chinna question…<br>Namma first meet eppo?</p><form id="date-form"><div class="date-fields"><label>Day<input name="day" aria-label="Day" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="2" placeholder="DD" required autocomplete="off"></label><span>/</span><label>Month<input name="month" aria-label="Month" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="2" placeholder="MM" required autocomplete="off"></label><span>/</span><label>Year<input name="year" aria-label="Year" inputmode="numeric" maxlength="4" placeholder="YYYY" required autocomplete="off"></label></div><button class="primary" type="submit">Open our little world <span>↗</span></button><p id="date-feedback" class="date-feedback" aria-live="polite">A day I’ll always keep close.</p><button type="button" id="date-hint" class="text-button">Need a tiny hint?</button></form><small>Your entrance comes with our song.</small></div></div><span class="entrance-bottom">A BIRTHDAY SURPRISE, SEALED WITH LOVE</span></section><div id="website" inert hidden><a class="skip" href="#story">Skip to our story</a><div class="progress" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<header><a class="brand" href="#home">for you<span>with all my love</span></a><nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#story">Our story</a><a href="#letters">Letters</a><a href="#play">Little joys</a></nav><span class="header-date">23 OCT ’26</span></header>
<main><section id="home" class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">23 OCTOBER · A DAY AS LOVELY AS YOU</p><h1>Happy Birthday,<br><em>Gunduuu.</em></h1><p class="handwritten hero-dedication">a little love letter you can wander through.</p><p class="intro">உனக்காக, அன்புடன்.<br>Our memories, a few stolen kisses,<br>and a whole little world of you & me.</p><button class="primary" id="begin">Let’s unwrap your day <span>↓</span></button><span class="hero-signoff">made with all my love 💗</span></div><div class="dream-scene" aria-label="An illustrated moon garden with our photograph"><svg class="garden-art" viewBox="0 0 540 600" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M30 540V265a240 240 0 0 1 480 0v275" fill="#f8dce4" stroke="#d88da6"/><path d="M45 530V270a225 225 0 0 1 450 0v260" stroke="#fff9f6" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 8"/><path d="M422 74c-64 5-75 89-14 112-81 18-115-90-48-125 18-9 42-7 62 13Z" fill="#fff5dc"/><path d="M18 484q70-27 140 0t145 0 220 0v77H18Z" fill="#f2c4d2"/><g stroke="#a45272" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M78 545Q47 433 87 353M66 474q-50-7-44-41 31-2 44 41m7-63q38-33 49-10-6 28-49 30M466 547q42-104-4-180m13 103q38-6 43-40-35-2-43 40m-3-50q-41-17-40-45 38 4 40 45"/><g fill="#fff0f2"><path d="M83 366c-47-20-20-56 1-28 7-41 48-24 23 6 43 7 16 48-9 24-9 38-43 23-15-2Z"/><path d="M462 380c-42-23-13-53 4-26 13-39 48-18 19 8 41 12 10 49-12 22-14 37-45 15-11-4Z"/></g></g><path d="M140 78q-40-54-75-15-4 35 75 15 71-40 63-6-11 31-63 6m0 0-27 45m27-45 35 30" stroke="#b36a85" stroke-width="3"/></svg><div class="dream-photo"><img src="assets/03.webp" alt="One of our happiest little moments" fetchpriority="high"><span>my favourite place is next to you.</span></div><span class="scene-stamp">YOU & ME<br><b>always a little magic</b></span><div class="hero-bow" aria-hidden="true"></div></div><a class="scroll-note" href="#story">THE GOOD STUFF IS THIS WAY ↓</a></section><div class="ribbon" aria-hidden="true">Gunduuu · Chellameyyyy · Azhgiiiiii · Ladduuuu · Thangameyyy · Gunduuu · Gulab Jamun Eyy · Azhagupulla ·</div>
<section id="story" class="section story"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">01 / THE DAYS THAT BECAME US</p><h2>Some dates.<br><em>So many feelings.</em></h2><p>Gunduuu, namma story-la ovvoru chinna moment-um enakku special. 💗</p></div><div class="timeline"><article class="reveal"><span class="date">12 JANUARY 2024</span><h3>The beginning of us.</h3><p>A date that will always mean something to me. The start of a little world called “us”.</p><div class="day-count"><b id="days">—</b><span>days since our beginning<br><small>and so many little memories</small></span></div></article><article class="reveal"><span class="date">24 MAY 2024</span><h3>Finally, in the same place.</h3><p>Our first meeting. Un kai, en kai… and a day I keep close. 🤌🏻</p><button class="polaroid photo first-selfie" data-img="10" data-caption="Our first-ever selfie · 24 May 2024"><img src="assets/10.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Our first-ever selfie together"><span>our very first selfie, Gunduuu.</span></button><div class="two-photos"><button class="polaroid photo" data-img="06" data-caption="Our first meeting · 24 May 2024"><img src="assets/06.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Our hands together on our first meeting day"><span>that first-meeting feeling</span></button><button class="polaroid photo" data-img="02" data-caption="Side by side · our first meeting"><img src="assets/02.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Our feet side by side"><span>side by side, Gunduuu</span></button></div></article><article class="reveal movie"><div><span class="date">OUR FIRST MOVIE DATE</span><h3>Two tickets.<br>One favourite person.</h3><p>Movie memories are lovely. Sitting beside you? Even lovelier, Chellameyyyy. 🙈</p></div><button class="polaroid photo" data-img="13" data-caption="The tickets from our first movie date"><img src="assets/13.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Our yellow movie tickets"><span>keep this ticket forever</span></button></article></div></section>
<section class="favourite section" id="favourite"><div class="favourite-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">02 / OUR ALL-TIME FAVOURITE</p><h2>If a photograph<br>could feel like<br><em>home.</em></h2><p>This would be mine.</p><p>Gunduuu, indha photo-ku oru thani place.<br>In this little website. And in my heart. 💗</p><button class="text-button photo" data-img="07" data-caption="Our all-time favourite staircase photograph">Hold this moment a little closer ↗</button></div><div class="stair-scene reveal"><div class="orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div><span class="handwritten">my favourite view is you</span><img src="assets/07.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Our favourite staircase portrait, lovingly framed"><span class="scene-foot">A MOMENT I WOULD KEEP FOREVER</span></div></section>
<section class="portrait-section section" id="just-you"><div class="portrait-frame reveal"><img src="assets/09.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Gunduuu smiling in her yellow dress beneath hanging lights"><svg class="bow-art" viewBox="0 0 200 130" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M94 53C64 10 9 5 18 41c5 23 42 28 76 20M106 53c30-43 85-48 76-12-5 23-42 28-76 20"/><path d="M88 57C53 34 34 28 24 35m88 22c35-23 54-29 64-22"/><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M91 61c-3 25-21 42-44 47l13-20-22-4c25 1 40-10 53-23m18 0c3 25 21 42 44 47l-13-20 22-4c-25 1-40-10-53-23"/><path fill="#D46C8C" d="M90 48q10-5 20 0v18q-10 5-20 0z"/></g></svg><span class="portrait-label">my Azhgiiiiii.</span></div><div class="portrait-copy reveal"><p class="eyebrow">A WHOLE LITTLE CHAPTER, JUST FOR YOU</p><h2>That smile.<br><em>My favourite<br>kind of sunshine.</em></h2><p>Gunduuu, indha page unakkaaga mattum.</p><p>May you keep finding things that make your eyes light up. Your dreams, your laughter, your happiness — I’m wishing you more of all of them.</p><p class="handwritten">நீ சந்தோஷமா இருக்கணும், Gunduuu. 💗</p><svg class="flower-art" viewBox="0 0 140 210" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M68 202c8-53 15-100 3-143M73 153c-33 1-49-17-48-36 28-2 43 15 48 36m4-26c35-2 46-26 41-42-24 3-37 19-41 42" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3"/><g class="flower-head" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" fill="#FBB3BB"><path d="M70 45C39-8 9 22 43 53 0 69 29 107 58 76c1 46 46 44 34 3 39 19 57-23 18-32 21-38-18-53-40-2Z"/><circle cx="73" cy="60" r="14" fill="#D46C8C"/></g></svg></div></section><section class="section scrapbook" id="memories"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">03 / THE SCRAPBOOK</p><h2>Little pieces of<br><em>our kind of magic.</em></h2><p>Tap a photograph. Stay a little longer.</p></div><div class="scrap-grid" id="scrap-grid"></div><div class="special-memories"><article class="reveal"><button class="polaroid photo" data-img="11" data-caption="Your birthday balloon · 2024"><img src="assets/11.webp" loading="lazy" alt="The green birthday balloon from 2024"><span>your birthday, 2024 💗</span></button><h3>Some things never stop being special.</h3><p>One little balloon. A whole birthday memory.</p></article><article class="reveal"><button class="polaroid photo" data-img="01" data-caption="Our most recent meeting"><img src="assets/01.webp" loading="lazy" alt="The two of us walking together at our most recent meeting"><span>our most recent little chapter</span></button><h3>Until the next “Gunduuu!”</h3><p>The latest page in our scrapbook. There is still room for more.</p></article></div><button class="text-button" id="show-more" aria-expanded="false">Unfold more little memories +</button><div id="more-memories" class="more-memories" hidden></div></section>
<section class="section letters" id="letters"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">04 / WORDS I WANTED TO GIVE YOU</p><h2>For the things<br><em>a photo can’t say.</em></h2><p>Open whenever you feel like it, Gunduuu.</p></div><div class="envelopes"><button class="envelope reveal" data-letter="birthday"><span class="envelope-label">01 · FOR YOUR BIRTHDAY</span><span class="seal">P</span><span class="handwritten">My dearest Gunduuu,</span><small>tap to unfold</small></button><button class="envelope reveal" data-letter="love"><span class="envelope-label">02 · JUST BECAUSE IT’S YOU</span><span class="seal">P</span><span class="handwritten">Chellameyyyy,</span><small>a little love letter</small></button><button class="envelope reveal" data-letter="sorry"><span class="envelope-label">03 · FROM MY HEART</span><span class="seal">P</span><span class="handwritten">An honest sorry.</span><small>no expectations, just honesty</small></button></div></section>
<section class="section joys" id="play"><div class="section-heading reveal"><p class="eyebrow">05 / A LITTLE SILLY. A LOT OF LOVE.</p><h2>A little more us.<br><em>Stay and play.</em></h2></div><div class="joy-grid"><article class="joy-card"><span class="eyebrow">SOMETHING TO FEEL</span><h3>A little closer.</h3><svg class="bunny-art" viewBox="0 0 360 260" aria-label="Two bunnies: choose a cuddle or a cheek kiss" role="img"><ellipse cx="180" cy="233" rx="125" ry="13" fill="#e9adc2" opacity=".4"/><g class="bunny-left"><g fill="#fffaf8" stroke="#a45073" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cx="124" cy="191" rx="53" ry="44"/><path d="M87 105C49 18 91 8 109 85c0-89 42-82 34 8 65 26 40 101-17 102-65 0-85-53-39-90Z"/></g><path d="m100 132 8 1m33-1 8-1m-33 18q9 9 18 0" stroke="#8e3b5d" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><ellipse cx="99" cy="147" rx="12" ry="6" fill="#efb8c9"/><path class="cuddle-arm" d="M119 182q48 48 90 4" fill="none" stroke="#a45073" stroke-width="11" stroke-linecap="round"/><path class="kiss-mouth" d="m153 147 8 4-8 4" stroke="#9b3160" stroke-width="3" fill="none"/></g><g class="bunny-right"><g fill="#f4b6c9" stroke="#a45073" stroke-width="3"><ellipse cx="235" cy="191" rx="52" ry="44"/><path d="M201 101c-20-92 22-95 27-19 22-82 60-63 31 25 51 44 17 88-31 88-62-1-80-57-27-94Z"/></g><path d="m211 133 8 1m32-2 8-1m-33 19q10 9 18-1" stroke="#8e3b5d" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round"/><ellipse class="kiss-blush" cx="211" cy="149" rx="13" ry="7" fill="#df7e9f"/><path class="cuddle-arm" d="M252 182q-43 45-72 8" fill="none" stroke="#a45073" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/></g><path class="kiss-heart" d="M185 88c-29-22-4-39 0-21 8-21 32-2 0 21Z" fill="#bd5d80"/></svg><div class="button-row"><button class="primary" id="hug">A hug, please 🥺</button><button class="secondary" id="kiss">One kiss 😚</button></div><p id="affection" aria-live="polite">Even from here, a little warmth for you.</p></article><article class="joy-card"><span class="eyebrow">SOMETHING TO FIND</span><h3>Made for each other.</h3><p>Find four pairs of our favourite photographs.</p><div class="memory-game" id="memory-game" aria-label="Matching pairs game"></div><p id="game-status" aria-live="polite">0 / 4 pairs found</p><button class="text-button" id="reset-game">Shuffle & play again ↻</button></article><article class="joy-card new-game"><span class="eyebrow">A LOVE NOTE, ONE PIECE AT A TIME</span><h3>Put us into words.</h3><p>Tap the words in order to finish our little love note.</p><div id="word-answer" class="word-answer" aria-live="polite"></div><div id="word-choices" class="word-choices"></div><p id="word-status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="word-reset" class="text-button">Start this note again ↻</button></article><article class="joy-card new-game"><span class="eyebrow">A LITTLE GAME OF HIDE & SEEK</span><h3>Where’s my kiss?</h3><p>A kiss is hiding in one of these envelopes. Find three to fill your letter.</p><div id="kiss-envelopes" class="kiss-envelopes"></div><p id="seek-status" aria-live="polite">Pick a little love letter.</p><button id="seek-next" class="text-button" hidden>Hide it again ↻</button></article><article class="joy-card new-game"><span class="eyebrow">TWO LITTLE SOULS, ONE LITTLE PATH</span><h3>Meet me in the middle.</h3><p>Guide the pink heart to its match. Use the arrows, or your keyboard.</p><div id="love-maze" class="love-maze" aria-label="Love maze"></div><div class="maze-controls"><button data-step="-5" aria-label="Move up">↑</button><button data-step="-1" aria-label="Move left">←</button><button data-step="5" aria-label="Move down">↓</button><button data-step="1" aria-label="Move right">→</button></div><p id="maze-status" aria-live="polite">A few little turns, then together.</p><button id="maze-reset" class="text-button">Find you all over again ↻</button></article><article class="joy-card"><span class="eyebrow">SOMETHING TO REMEMBER</span><h3>Our little date game.</h3><p id="quiz-question"></p><div id="quiz-answers"></div><p id="quiz-status" aria-live="polite"></p><button id="quiz-next" class="text-button" hidden>Next question →</button></article></div></section>
<section class="section blessings" aria-labelledby="blessing-title"><div class="section-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE PRAYER FOR YOUR NEW YEAR</p><h2 id="blessing-title">Wonderfully made.<br><em>Deeply loved.</em></h2><p>On your birthday, I thank God for you, Chellameyyyy. May His love surround you, His peace stay with you, and His goodness light the days ahead. 💗</p></div><div class="psalm-grid"><blockquote><span class="verse-flower" aria-hidden="true">✝</span><p>“I will praise thee; for I am fearfully and wonderfully made”</p><cite><a href="https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Psalm+139%3A14&amp;version=KJV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Psalm 139:14 · KJV, excerpt</a></cite><small>A little reminder of how beautifully God made you.</small></blockquote><blockquote><span class="verse-flower" aria-hidden="true">✝</span><p>“Surely goodness and mercy shall follow me all the days of my life”</p><cite><a href="https://www.biblegateway.com/passage/?search=Psalm+23%3A6&amp;version=KJV" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Psalm 23:6 · KJV, excerpt</a></cite><small>My birthday prayer: goodness, grace, and love in every season.</small></blockquote></div><p class="blessing-note">இறைவனின் அன்பும் ஆசீர்வாதமும் என்றும் உன்னுடன் இருக்கட்டும்.</p></section>
<section class="section birthday" id="birthday"><p class="eyebrow reveal">06 / TODAY, THE WORLD GETS TO CELEBRATE YOU</p><h2 class="reveal">Make a wish,<br><em>Gunduuu.</em></h2><p>Un smile eppovum ippadiye irukkanum, Gunduuu. 💗</p><div class="cake" aria-label="Birthday cake with three candles"><div class="candles"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="cake-top"></div><div class="cake-body"><span>for Gunduuu</span></div><div class="cake-plate"></div></div><div id="cake-countdown" class="cake-countdown" role="status" aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true"></div><button class="primary" id="wish">Make a wish & blow the candles</button><p id="wish-message" aria-live="polite">A wish that belongs only to you.</p><button class="text-button" id="relight" hidden>Light the candles again ↻</button></section>
<section class="ending section"><svg class="bow-art" viewBox="0 0 200 130" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><g stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M94 53C64 10 9 5 18 41c5 23 42 28 76 20M106 53c30-43 85-48 76-12-5 23-42 28-76 20"/><path d="M88 57C53 34 34 28 24 35m88 22c35-23 54-29 64-22"/><path fill="#FBB3BB" d="M91 61c-3 25-21 42-44 47l13-20-22-4c25 1 40-10 53-23m18 0c3 25 21 42 44 47l-13-20 22-4c-25 1-40-10-53-23"/><path fill="#D46C8C" d="M90 48q10-5 20 0v18q-10 5-20 0z"/></g></svg><p class="eyebrow">THE LAST PAGE. NEVER THE LAST FEELING.</p><h2>In every little way,<br><em>you matter, Gunduuu.</em></h2><p>Happy Birthday Gunduuu 💗😚<br>May this year bring you gentleness, laughter,<br>and so many reasons to smile.</p><p class="handwritten">எப்போதும் அன்புடன், உன் Papa.</p><button id="secret" aria-label="A hidden little note" class="secret">💗</button><small>psst… some feelings are hiding in plain sight.</small><a href="#home" class="text-button">Read our story again ↑</a></section></main>
<footer>Made for Gunduuu. Kept with love. <span>23 · 10 · 2026</span></footer></div>
